      (text "ESP32: VISTA FRONTAL, ANTENA ARRIBA / USB ABAJO; posiciones L01-L19 y R01-R19 desde arriba." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "35b6c069-e990-549d-9b3e-d91b1f8590ec")) (text "FUENTE 12 V / 3 A -> LM2596 ajustado 5,0 V -> ESP32 5V0 y PMS5003 en paralelo. GND comun." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "097d5a71-b0ad-5b12-b85a-eb4da4484319")) (text "TFT 1,54 y 1,9: mismos pines; cambia resolucion/codigo. Verificar serigrafia real antes de cablear." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "93670ecd-1252-516e-80c3-de720198da5e")) (text "Cruces sin punto de union = NO conectados. Ninguna linea de 12 V llega al ESP32." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ca25fa9c-ff95-5905-9fd6-1d2548eb945c")) (text "ESP32 L01/3V3 -> SCD40 VCC, TFT VCC y TFT BLK en paralelo. Verificar capacidad del 3V3 con WiFi activo." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3785e81b-ab8b-5bd3-9489-438b71dcc264")) (text "PMS SET, RESET y NC quedan libres. Los simbolos son de conexion; sin footprint para fabricar PCB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "13ff9fee-ad51-53ae-8a68-c79e1bfefe8f")) (text "Modo: cables visibles" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "30c12825-ef7f-50bc-83e6-53fdf20bd571"))
